  era: "Section 14 \xB7 Delhi Sultanate \xB7 1206 \u2013 1526"
  title: Lodi Dynasty
  text: The Lodis, Afghan rulers from 1451 to 1526, included Bahlul, Sikandar, who founded the city of Agra, and Ibrahim Lodi, who was defeated and killed by Babur at the First Battle of Panipat in 1526, ending the sultanate.
